Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:21.28,Title,0,0,0,0,,《超时空！呼风唤雨之我的新娘》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 绊到小石子 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 稍微有点痛 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.96,0:00:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 看吧 你已经在笑了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这样的话 不就没事了吗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如此般的幸福便是 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:01:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 路上随处可见的吧 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.09,0:01:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ HAPPY HAPPY 炸裂的能量 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 兴高采烈 灼热的心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 二人相遇后 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 会引起风暴的活力 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 心中的天气 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机新产品
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的阴谋到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,5岁的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要5岁的我的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,全自动清扫机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,累了一天了 有了它 回家后就什么都不需要做
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊咧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是婚纱吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来放在这种地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是么 你是第一次看到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着还很合适呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真怀念啊 真是首好歌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人想起青春的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,少在这里妨碍我回忆青春
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈说想扮演圣诞老人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣诞老人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说3点的点心吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是说中山裕介
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级必杀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公 快看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？是婚礼时用的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,整理冬天的东西的时候找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.11,0:07:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不准喝啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很适合 很适合 可爱 漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.98,0:07:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.82,0:07:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好老套
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来杯啤酒总可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但厕所和浴室的打扫工作就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.93,0:08:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿得这么华丽的老太婆 是想迷惑村人博
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.87,0:08:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.14,0:08:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是华丽的老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师 帮我画的漫画 画完了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.27,0:08:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个跟我主演的电影很适合啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 老师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我约好了要和大公司的社长一起吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.95,0:08:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:09:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会为了大家而努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请相信我 跟随我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大社长风间会为了大家努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,风间社长
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.76,0:09:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是美女演员妮妮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.50,0:09:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,本公司的新商品很快就要完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那现在就去研究所
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆博士 研究进展如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级机器 完成
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 在玩什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演未来的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.49,0:09:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮演未来的自己？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将来会成为超级走红的漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,连载20本 每本都非常受欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一流企业的社长 日本经济的支柱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.57,0:09:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我是美女演员 和很多名人都是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久就将与名人结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是发明家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.55,0:10:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新有没有什么梦想和希望？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长大了之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我像现在这样就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.73,0:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子却没有梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我的梦想就是当小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许新之助一辈子都是小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.11,0:10:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫非是屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.42,0:10:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.79,0:10:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是屁股吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是屁股呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌啦 大家 屁股屁股说个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.09,0:10:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是第一次看到我的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.93,0:10:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新的上面
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.70,0:10:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 对不起 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是半个屁股？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.41,0:11:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光好暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳 真是个好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.23,0:11:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那理性的额头 清澈的瞳孔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧抿的小嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.31,0:11:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上认出你了 新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,能见到你真是太好了 我就相信能见到你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起走吧 新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 在那呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 新之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.48,0:12:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.79,0:12:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.65,0:12:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的新之助需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在要回到未来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.43,0:12:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.23,0:12:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有怪物 鬼怪之类的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是魔界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,比春日部更热闹的城镇吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是都市
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.21,0:12:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃起来舌头辣乎乎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,辣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,连想都没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐姐和妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.62,0:12:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面放着青豌豆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.82,0:12:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧卖 不是说这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在什么都要失去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.22,0:12:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是野原新之助没错呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和新之助完全一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都这节骨眼了 还开着玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这节骨眼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.31,0:13:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 又被带入了他的节奏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.61,0:13:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 要回到未来去了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.28,0:13:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,通向未来的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 小新
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人们不是说过不能跟着不认识的人走嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人是谁？是新之助的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.89,0:13:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说成不认识的人 真是失礼诶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是野原新之助的未婚妻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔芋店？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指要成为小新新娘的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的新娘？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 终于明白了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助是我的新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,受新之助的委托 现在要带你去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助需要你去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 要走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,到练钢琴的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来有卖限量发售的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,特制巧克力哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,特制巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.65,0:14:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去未来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 时间机器 启动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.60,0:14:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 小新
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子 久美 久美美
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你喜欢的叫法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是小新 久美 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.10,0:15:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是海 太平洋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.33,0:15:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,春日部可没海的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新的世界虽然没有 可是现在是有的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且一整天都像夜晚一样的黑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.88,0:15:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是未来的春日部 现在叫Neo Tokio
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.91,0:16:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哈 好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有牌洗衣机
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次解决干净
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比方说即使这么脏……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也有动感超人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.83,0:16:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帅
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？小新？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 要做便当的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,磨碎的纳豆和小颗的纳豆 哪个更好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.21,0:16:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.05,0:16:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是搭讪的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.55,0:16:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须尽快回到新之助那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.06,0:16:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:16:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到新之助再说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.27,0:17:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.63,0:17:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 店刚刚走过了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次遇到比老妈还厉害的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的是美伢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识我老妈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看过照片 是个很漂亮的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.92,0:17:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈给人的感觉 与其说是漂亮倒不如说是无敌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然 毕竟培养了新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还培养着小新
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.36,0:17:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.46,0:17:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助说了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,“去把5岁的我带来”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此要把你带到那个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.67,0:17:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我带去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.84,0:17:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.74,0:17:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在新之助需要小新
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助想让这个世界明亮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.03,0:18:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可很难搞到手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金有的高级货
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住 你这个吃霸王餐的家伙 给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 我讨厌这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今后该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有先找到新之助和那个怪女人了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我们真的时空旅行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真的是未来的世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧 因为
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还从未见过那么大的大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.10,0:18:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.07,0:18:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.87,0:18:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,分开的话可不好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.51,0:18:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.78,0:19:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 好像过不去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找找其他的路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.65,0:19:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这里真的是未来的世界的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会有未来的我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.86,0:19:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.36,0:19:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫自己帮忙的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会来帮忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.66,0:19:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定是个大老板 即使不是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也一定是个相当成功的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.54,0:19:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办才好 20岁左右就跟名人闪电结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,书店 有没有书店呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,刊登着我漫画的书
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,便利店
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.82,0:19:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫画 我的漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.37,0:19:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.08,0:20:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶 好啊 买吧 买吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,1800日元
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好贵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.62,0:20:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来式价格
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让长大的自己请客
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.49,0:20:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.93,0:20:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,正男
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.73,0:20:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.23,0:20:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,切 什么嘛 这种新连载
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 无聊 根本就是渣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道编辑部是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,切 让人气愤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是正男吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,饭团仔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫画家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你知道我的漫画吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.33,0:20:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么嘛 原来是粉丝啊 看过吗 我的热门作品
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.23,0:20:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,假面正男W
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,3周就被截止了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.74,0:21:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是有连载到20本吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有动画化吗 拍成电影了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烦 你是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是 在做什么啊 这样的你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很失望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,正男
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正男
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我？什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让世界明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.90,0:21:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指开很多电灯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那样 是说人的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在心中放灯泡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,明亮是指让人的内心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.88,0:21:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,噗通一下变得愉快开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.62,0:21:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？ 噗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一想到接下来有巧克力吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.85,0:21:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不开心吗 噗通
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.19,0:21:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 会的会的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.49,0:21:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是明快的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是不给我买的话 就心情低沉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.33,0:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助如果没事的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.23,0:22:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃多少都行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉手指
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.78,0:22:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎的话要吞一千根针
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.85,0:22:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是角野卓造哦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.87,0:22:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.15,0:22:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前的政府公司的事 把它搞垮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.75,0:22:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有利用价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:22:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事 那个进展如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.99,0:23:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说那个的话就指那个 不是只有一个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.10,0:23:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不劳您费心 社长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.97,0:23:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该准备的我都已经准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 已经监视了整条街
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.77,0:23:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会又给他们钱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会 不会那么浪费的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.78,0:23:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好 出资要尽可能的节约
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,节约
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是做生意的原则
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使对方是傻女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 还有 社长
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我之前通知您的 总理大臣在等着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.07,0:23:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他等着 一定又是来央求钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.17,0:23:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.91,0:23:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.38,0:23:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.11,0:23:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有关于我们的婚姻介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.61,0:24:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请包在我身上 大家好好干的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再怎么麻烦都帮你们搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是脸蛋 性格 还是收入 全部都很优秀的独身男性
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.54,0:24:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里吗？久美
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.78,0:24:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.95,0:24:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间都过去这么久了 可能被带走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.95,0:24:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 久美
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.55,0:24:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.62,0:24:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使被别人特意带走后不会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.92,0:24:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要在被带走之前赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.76,0:24:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就可以了？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.26,0:24:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样如果可以的话
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.89,0:24:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.33,0:24:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好容易理解呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.23,0:24:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以这样说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.17,0:24:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.17,0:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新在这里等我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.18,0:25:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要随便乱动哟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.39,0:25:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.56,0:25:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.69,0:25:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 新之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.70,0:25:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然变得这么小了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.17,0:25:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.74,0:25:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 是动感超人的玩具！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.18,0:25:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩具？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.88,0:25:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么看见玩具就哭啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.85,0:25:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是玩具 这是新之助！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那个玩具给我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能把新之助给你呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.73,0:25:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 给你！噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一条新留言
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.87,0:26:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 久美子 你在听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.87,0:26:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.27,0:26:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,被生物橡胶包裹着保管着
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.94,0:26:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还要新之助的话 就给我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.18,0:26:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不回来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.81,0:26:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助就不知会变成什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.55,0:26:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 等你消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我不打算一直等下去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.89,0:26:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.49,0:26:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛 痛 痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.96,0:26:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会坏掉呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.86,0:26:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是坏掉 是被弄坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.97,0:26:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.30,0:26:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才那人是谁？久美的熟人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.82,0:26:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.22,0:26:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美的老爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.25,0:26:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.52,0:26:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.69,0:26:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.24,0:27:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子时候的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.74,0:27:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,25岁的我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该成为
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,美丽的新娘的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.29,0:27:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.43,0:27:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知不觉成剩女了（アラサー 25岁到34岁 ）
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人的幸福并不值得高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.02,0:27:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想早点结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.72,0:27:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,想早点怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.16,0:28:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想成为专业家庭主妇
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.86,0:28:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.33,0:28:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是可是 还没有对象
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.47,0:28:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩女 剩女
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.41,0:28:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩女啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 胸罩 胸罩
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.85,0:28:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说太棒了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.86,0:28:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 危险？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.46,0:28:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.57,0:28:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有久美子吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.07,0:28:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.91,0:28:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱情
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.91,0:28:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,算计
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.88,0:28:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,理想
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.91,0:28:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.21,0:28:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,的剩女
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.35,0:28:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.78,0:28:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字叫做…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.42,0:29:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,新娘（志愿）军团
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.65,0:29:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然跟金有久美子没仇！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.46,0:29:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是为了我们的相亲会
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你为交易筹码
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.66,0:29:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,相亲的事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.26,0:29:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,任意挑选
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.87,0:29:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,盛情招待
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.87,0:29:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们因此一起前来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.94,0:29:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.78,0:29:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.55,0:29:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该说对不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.78,0:29:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,变得跟告白前被拒绝似的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.68,0:29:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我总是被拒绝…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.42,0:29:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话只能直接用武力解决了！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是决定跟我们走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.10,0:29:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.37,0:29:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机 单身社员的名片！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.07,0:29:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.77,0:29:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.81,0:29:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.21,0:30:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你干嘛！讨厌 我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.95,0:30:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要准备逃走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.78,0:30:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.26,0:30:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.01,0:30:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈说过
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.98,0:30:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生有山峰也有山谷
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.65,0:30:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个正男现在可能刚处在谷底呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.92,0:30:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不会再比这更糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.82,0:30:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么呀！一点都不能安慰人！
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.59,0:30:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.36,0:30:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是也不知道自己变成怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.36,0:30:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 讨厌 我的话肯定没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.70,0:31:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会有一个大的院子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.77,0:31:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多孩子围在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.18,0:31:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.58,0:31:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是双叶幼稚园
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.82,0:31:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？是咱 是咱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.75,0:31:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱 在扫地
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.79,0:31:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.86,0:31:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.13,0:31:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 给我介绍一个有钱的男人？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.86,0:31:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说过不用了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.13,0:31:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.97,0:31:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮妮老师
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.43,0:31:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.14,0:31:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到我在打电话吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.64,0:31:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.58,0:31:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘛！院子蛮大的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.58,0:31:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有很多孩子围在身边
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.15,0:31:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我想想原理
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.79,0:31:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.86,0:31:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 那个 很有精神的样子 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.83,0:31:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神 精神
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.73,0:32:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不会比这更糟糕的了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.83,0:32:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.57,0:32:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 风间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.07,0:32:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有公园的奇怪女人！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.91,0:32:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.78,0:32:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这句应该是我们问的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.94,0:32:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,风间 后面！恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.71,0:32:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.18,0:32:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 金有久美子！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.95,0:32:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.19,0:32:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不是单身男性社员的名片！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.36,0:32:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部是白纸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.80,0:32:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.10,0:32:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.47,0:32:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,30岁的纯情
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.97,0:32:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样被玩弄了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.34,0:32:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼玫瑰 发射
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.74,0:32:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,订婚盾牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.94,0:32:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,烛光火焰！接招
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.91,0:32:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,求婚灭火器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.45,0:32:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要得意！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.05,0:32:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为能从
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.75,0:32:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满爱与信念的我们手中逃走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.72,0:32:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:32:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主降落 受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.36,0:33:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,妨碍我们良缘的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.23,0:33:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.44,0:33:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.80,0:33:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快追
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.48,0:33:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那边
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.98,0:33:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.71,0:33:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.11,0:33:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明是金有电机的千金
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.85,0:33:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要跟社长对着干呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.75,0:33:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前可是非常乖巧懂事的好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.22,0:33:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不同了！现在的我只是久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,和金有电机没有任何关系了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.19,0:33:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的借口有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.41,0:33:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,机会！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.57,0:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是我第一个结婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.64,0:33:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不看看自己什么条件
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.58,0:33:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,年龄最大
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.71,0:33:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件最差
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.91,0:33:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么呀 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.42,0:33:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛 鼻子都不咋样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不穿好看的衣服的话
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.69,0:34:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本引起不了别人的注意
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.49,0:34:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.95,0:34:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你想打架吗 来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.39,0:34:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？你是男的？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.39,0:34:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,变性人哦 有什么不满吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.36,0:34:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不满呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.87,0:34:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,内讧了？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩恋爱前
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.37,0:34:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道和女性朋友间不会有结果了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.65,0:34:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.35,0:34:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.99,0:34:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,被奇怪的人带到奇怪的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.36,0:34:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还被卷入奇怪的事被奇怪的人追
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.20,0:34:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 你们说的最初的怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.50,0:34:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.13,0:34:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.47,0:34:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新之助的新娘！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.97,0:34:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是和你们说了很多遍了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.64,0:35:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是最奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.68,0:35:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.61,0:35:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新哪点好啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.08,0:35:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 是呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.32,0:35:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说的话 脸蛋 还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.72,0:35:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没在问你
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.76,0:35:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪点好…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.32,0:35:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.73,0:35:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车里的那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.43,0:35:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.96,0:35:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助给我让座位了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.67,0:35:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为站着可以
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.67,0:35:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到车外的漂亮小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.84,0:35:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我买冰激凌
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.87,0:35:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,店员一定是位美女吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.78,0:35:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 这个呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.61,0:35:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我悲伤的时候他什么也不说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.55,0:35:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直陪在我身边 这就是最大的温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为只是他睡着了而已
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.09,0:35:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,客观地来看
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,被无能男人吸引的女人 也是个无能的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.56,0:35:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 久美 不能输
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.60,0:35:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 加油 久美
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.14,0:36:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没在鼓励
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.64,0:36:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实新之助是个愚蠢庸俗的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.24,0:36:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.61,0:36:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马马虎虎 懒散 又烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.98,0:36:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得信赖 随便 毫无是处
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.35,0:36:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本没有任何优点的人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.99,0:36:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的有点过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.19,0:36:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.32,0:36:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.79,0:36:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是和我一起那么快乐的人没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.60,0:36:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快乐？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.13,0:36:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.07,0:36:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们和小新一起很快乐吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.67,0:36:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然有不好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起玩的时候心情很好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.08,0:36:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.85,0:36:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.95,0:36:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人困惑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.55,0:36:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常喜欢姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.72,0:36:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有麻烦的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.39,0:36:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 只要和新之助在一起 心情就会变得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.43,0:37:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 摸别人头发的老太婆出现
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.13,0:37:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的地方被揉了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.14,0:37:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没揉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.44,0:37:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么啊 突然之间
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.64,0:37:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.81,0:37:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓住了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.35,0:37:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.11,0:37:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.98,0:37:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,要这个孩子的命的话就老实地照我说的做
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事问你
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.15,0:37:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.16,0:37:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗 不可以 可以吗 不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.63,0:37:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 可以吗 你在干什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.03,0:37:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在占卜婚事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.83,0:37:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.84,0:37:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,结不了婚 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.47,0:37:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以结婚 耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.21,0:37:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,结不了婚 讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.87,0:37:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗 不可以 可以吗 不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.71,0:37:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.51,0:37:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.45,0:37:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.75,0:37:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,结不了婚
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.05,0:37:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.95,0:38:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美结不了婚是指
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.46,0:38:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？是帮我占的卜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.86,0:38:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.13,0:38:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美是单身
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.73,0:38:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一辈子单身
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.40,0:38:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.87,0:38:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,单身女人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.07,0:38:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.77,0:38:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.64,0:38:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.78,0:38:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 被逃走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.79,0:38:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新让我看看你的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.79,0:38:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚她刺你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.63,0:38:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不痛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.23,0:38:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点红肿了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.37,0:38:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会的 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.53,0:38:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经肿了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.00,0:38:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有肿！
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.07,0:38:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.01,0:38:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 小新
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.04,0:38:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.71,0:38:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚 保护了我
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.31,0:39:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助你的费用1亿万日元 可以贷款
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.32,0:39:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.65,0:39:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再和父亲一起生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经没有价值了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.43,0:39:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对金有电机而言只是麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.00,0:39:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.34,0:39:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力 很好吃的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.08,0:39:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起吃着巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.45,0:39:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很小确是真实的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.68,0:39:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.55,0:39:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,巧克力费一亿万日元
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.75,0:39:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.29,0:39:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以贷款
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.69,0:39:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是一个样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.13,0:39:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明很温柔却那么不直接
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.31,0:40:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 久美 未来的巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.38,0:40:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.51,0:40:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.26,0:40:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.76,0:40:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.69,0:40:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.76,0:40:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你在这里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.20,0:40:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.23,0:40:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要随便消失哟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶 久美子小姐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.45,0:40:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经饿的咕咕叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.72,0:40:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.12,0:40:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 吃在这种地方买的东西的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.36,0:40:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈会生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.36,0:40:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种地方是妈妈会来的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.33,0:40:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.53,0:40:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是肚子饿坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.83,0:40:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.80,0:41:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吵了 只会让肚子更饿
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.47,0:41:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啵 啵 水 有水
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.67,0:41:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.11,0:41:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.68,0:41:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗓子好干呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.31,0:41:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.65,0:41:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.12,0:41:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.59,0:41:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.51,0:41:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.47,0:41:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉 你去那里呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.65,0:41:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊哟…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.75,0:41:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 老妈 小葵 小白
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.99,0:41:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 老妈 小葵 小白
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.79,0:42:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.87,0:42:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,小白？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.87,0:42:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.07,0:42:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小白！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.68,0:42:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.65,0:42:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要呀 小白
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.39,0:42:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好多小白
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.79,0:43:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.79,0:43:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？好吵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.00,0:43:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.24,0:43:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太小白 吉小白 子小白
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.14,0:43:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,美小白 小白太郎 小白次郎 丸小白
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.04,0:43:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,音小白 小小白 杜小白
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.77,0:43:20.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能安静下吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.48,0:43:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.64,0:43:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,汪汪…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.48,0:43:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.45,0:43:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是老爸？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.16,0:43:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.36,0:43:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公 你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.13,0:43:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.73,0:43:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.24,0:43:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 变得这个样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.60,0:43:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会变成这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.77,0:43:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我想问的才对！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.94,0:43:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助！哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.18,0:43:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.68,0:43:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.85,0:44:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,正男君 妮妮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.35,0:44:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,风间君 还有阿呆
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.32,0:44:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,叔叔 阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.89,0:44:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们点饭吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.67,0:44:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈 摸一摸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.07,0:44:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是再来一碗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.37,0:44:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.74,0:44:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.67,0:44:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用那么着急 饭又不会逃跑
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.68,0:44:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃罐头不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.44,0:44:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.35,0:44:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们从过去的世界过来
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.68,0:44:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这样的事情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.75,0:44:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸为什么会变成这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.66,0:44:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何啊 说不清啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前有很多 现在却什么都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.23,0:44:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是说头发
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.17,0:44:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈好像有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.17,0:44:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.40,0:44:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚子已经成一整段了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.94,0:44:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说赘肉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.04,0:45:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.61,0:45:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.58,0:45:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的家伙 打你你还那么开心
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.72,0:45:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个怪孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.09,0:45:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.66,0:45:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.66,0:45:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.79,0:45:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手感 这大小
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.83,0:45:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.03,0:45:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 这脸蛋还是这样柔软呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.56,0:45:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶 我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.93,0:45:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的啊 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.43,0:45:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.24,0:45:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.27,0:45:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完饭 去洗个澡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.31,0:45:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,消消疲劳 全身变得暖和
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.71,0:45:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮妮待会跟阿姨一起洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.45,0:45:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.65,0:45:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.15,0:45:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的像你说的那样？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.86,0:45:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.06,0:45:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会成为负担
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.76,0:45:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.13,0:45:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么讲？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.76,0:45:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吧 Neo Tokio的可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.73,0:45:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌管那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.53,0:46:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有增藏 是久美子的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.68,0:46:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,陨石的冲击改变了世界
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.85,0:46:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,春日部也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.12,0:46:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.05,0:46:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一天到晚都是黑暗 还有些冷
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.89,0:46:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.76,0:46:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摆脱困境 还必须得借助金有电机的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.00,0:46:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是社长金有增藏对不服从自己
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.97,0:46:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能帮助自己赚钱的 都一个个弄垮消灭掉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.64,0:46:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.31,0:46:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸上班的双叶商务公司也是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.25,0:46:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,赚的少的话头发就变少
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.79,0:46:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.19,0:46:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.29,0:47:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.50,0:47:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么歪理啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.67,0:47:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子 你真是个废物
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.61,0:47:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是我亲生女儿我才说的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.81,0:47:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管什么时候都应该有个甜美的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点你好像不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.02,0:47:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗 久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.15,0:47:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样的话 就是金有电机最大的负债者
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.96,0:47:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是金有电机的产品
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.99,0:47:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.66,0:47:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个人呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.13,0:47:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把自己说成一个人的话 就给我拿出价值来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.74,0:47:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机需要能赚钱的人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.78,0:47:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 马上过来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.61,0:47:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有价值的东西 连收拾的意义都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.15,0:47:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,改怎么处理才好 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.12,0:48:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近连扔掉东西都要收取手续费
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.19,0:48:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回收 再利用
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.69,0:48:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.10,0:48:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫我吗？金有社长
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.76,0:48:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在计算呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.17,0:48:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全从业人员中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.60,0:48:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最节省成本的就是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.80,0:48:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是符合所给工资的劳动力
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.81,0:48:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.31,0:48:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此有特别的奖金
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.31,0:48:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.78,0:48:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和久美子结婚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.75,0:48:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.09,0:48:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.79,0:48:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.60,0:48:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.93,0:48:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可说过的 会变成什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.60,0:48:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.60,0:48:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你好好保管着
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.10,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是会变得怎样由你的选择来决定
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.71,0:48:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,社长 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.08,0:48:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这样的话你就是下任社长了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.52,0:49:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.46,0:49:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 风间君
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.13,0:49:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.49,0:49:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.26,0:49:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的陷入黑暗了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.77,0:49:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况越来越不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.27,0:49:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,时钟八点 是晚上呢？还是白天？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.91,0:49:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,时常都不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.35,0:49:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 Neo Tokio的各位
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.02,0:49:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有增藏？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.72,0:49:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是提供安全 舒适 幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.76,0:49:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机社长金有增藏
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.43,0:49:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有一个重要通知要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.86,0:49:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我的女儿碰到一段很好的因缘
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.84,0:49:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定要结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.04,0:49:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.64,0:50:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子不是喜欢小新吗？为什么……
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.64,0:50:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们介绍一下新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.55,0:50:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们社的干部风间彻君
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.69,0:50:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 肯定因为那个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.73,0:50:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,同姓同名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.43,0:50:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是风间 彻 大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.37,0:50:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,本人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.47,0:50:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,唔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.74,0:50:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.87,0:50:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是奔着金钱去的 太差劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.37,0:50:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没有干
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.61,0:50:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然像风间
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.25,0:50:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,说像 你觉得我是怎样的？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.82,0:50:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 今天在金有电机大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.09,0:50:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,将举行两人的结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.86,0:50:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请赶紧买票来参加
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.63,0:50:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.13,0:50:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新 该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.47,0:51:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子小姐不是喜欢小新吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.47,0:51:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何会和风间结婚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.47,0:51:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.77,0:51:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有道理或许是被要挟结婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.64,0:51:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有增藏那家伙的话 很有可能会
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.12,0:51:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.48,0:51:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.72,0:51:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.65,0:51:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美还没有买巧克力给我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.52,0:51:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须得去见久美
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.00,0:52:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,门票五万日元一张
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.87,0:52:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他的礼金大概这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.38,0:52:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,又要赚到不少呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.75,0:52:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.02,0:52:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 难得穿得这么漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.65,0:52:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要请野原新之助来祝贺一下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.46,0:52:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙肯定也想看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.80,0:52:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你怎么…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.77,0:52:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助变得怎样都无所谓的话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.77,0:52:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.41,0:52:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,社长 久美子小姐 差不多到时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.91,0:52:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 走吧 久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.67,0:53:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有久美子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.47,0:53:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然比我们新娘（志愿）军团先结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.61,0:53:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且对象还是风间彻
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.78,0:53:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是窥伺很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.78,0:53:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.65,0:53:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是金有电机大厦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.59,0:53:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不允许随便入内
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.19,0:53:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,孙子
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.29,0:53:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让孙子来看看父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.13,0:53:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,孙子？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.96,0:53:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,孙子？过来 终于能和你爸爸见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.43,0:53:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.77,0:53:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.64,0:53:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得这个孩子看着像谁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.71,0:53:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.54,0:53:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看？像谁呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.61,0:53:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,和今天结婚的风间有点像吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.75,0:54:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀 这个孩子是风间的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.52,0:54:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.29,0:54:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.42,0:54:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是风间的孩子不像是说谎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.76,0:54:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为就是小时候的风间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.43,0:54:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别当我笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.16,0:54:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个孩子的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.63,0:54:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全一个模子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.37,0:54:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实模样有几分相似 我们没骗了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.84,0:54:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 看看风间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.87,0:54:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像是这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.38,0:54:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.64,0:54:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样肯定是别人的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.78,0:54:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 我想见父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.65,0:54:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可怜呀 让他见见父亲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.96,0:54:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.79,0:54:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.96,0:54:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.00,0:54:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.77,0:54:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,变身
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.65,0:55:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原广志因为头发多了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.75,0:55:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经的自信和动力都找回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.25,0:55:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原美伢因为时常活动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.19,0:55:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的年轻和美貌也都找回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.69,0:55:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗人的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.76,0:55:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是自我满足
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.39,0:55:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,假货
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.56,0:55:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不自然
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.73,0:55:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.00,0:55:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,假发 转移视线
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.60,0:55:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.00,0:55:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己感觉不错就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.67,0:55:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我给人感觉不同哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.21,0:55:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸老妈好帅呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.64,0:55:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新 各位 你们先走哟
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.14,0:55:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.05,0:55:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.85,0:55:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准过去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.19,0:55:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.76,0:55:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.42,0:55:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿黑
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.39,0:55:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.13,0:55:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.00,0:55:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.23,0:56:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀呀呀
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.90,0:56:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了晴天特意做的紧身衣
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.67,0:56:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这个的话又返回到三十岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.11,0:56:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人笑话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.44,0:56:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一时的美丽身材有什么用
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.71,0:56:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,本质上还是没有变
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.72,0:56:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.66,0:56:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.89,0:56:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看招
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.93,0:56:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.00,0:56:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原广志的自信和斗志
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.24,0:56:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,随着头发一同消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.35,0:56:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.62,0:56:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛看不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.75,0:56:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然不知道怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.79,0:56:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.22,0:56:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.76,0:56:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公 你好帅呀 我也要发招了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.73,0:57:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公！
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.00,0:57:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 赶紧走
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.80,0:57:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.64,0:57:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼前都在转
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.08,0:57:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下新娘（志愿）军团真正的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.06,0:57:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.96,0:57:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.84,0:57:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们 先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎到场
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.21,0:57:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么请新娘和新郎登场
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.23,0:58:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.87,0:58:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.48,0:58:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵呵
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.32,0:58:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.56,0:58:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.23,0:58:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.60,0:58:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美 我来接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.84,0:58:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.87,0:58:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.18,0:58:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.11,0:59:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美 久美和我一起走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.12,0:59:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.16,0:59:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.23,0:59:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？小新？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.53,0:59:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.00,0:59:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是小孩子的新之助
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.11,0:59:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.84,0:59:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是野原新之助吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.68,0:59:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就过去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.72,0:59:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果野原新之助变得怎样都无所谓的话
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.69,0:59:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那随便你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.77,0:59:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.63,0:59:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.47,0:59:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和风间先生结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以请你不要找我了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.58,1:00:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.51,1:00:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.56,1:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.96,1:00:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没吃巧克力呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.43,1:00:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是约好了的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.02,1:00:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感动了 真好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.12,1:00:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,要幸福啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.13,1:00:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏那个小子 反而热闹了气氛
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.53,1:00:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.47,1:01:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.09,1:01:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 为什么 久美
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.60,1:01:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美的新郎
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.60,1:01:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我才对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.03,1:01:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.27,1:01:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.75,1:01:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.36,1:02:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.63,1:02:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,新娘军团 快把那个小子带走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.34,1:02:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.78,1:02:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮小新吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.44,1:02:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.01,1:02:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.75,1:02:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让一下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.05,1:02:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.52,1:02:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.52,1:02:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.63,1:02:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,花束 链
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.80,1:02:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.73,1:02:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.00,1:02:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公！
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.77,1:02:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.71,1:02:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.38,1:02:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.65,1:02:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.95,1:02:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.82,1:02:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新 快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.09,1:03:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.79,1:03:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.73,1:03:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.33,1:03:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.10,1:03:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.73,1:03:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.60,1:03:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.47,1:03:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.74,1:03:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.77,1:03:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.82,1:03:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.46,1:03:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.52,1:03:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.93,1:03:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么呢！赶紧抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.20,1:03:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,花束
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.73,1:03:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.57,1:03:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.34,1:04:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.66,1:04:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈 真的好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.63,1:04:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.33,1:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.33,1:04:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在金有电机大厦举行的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.83,1:04:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为闯入的孩子们的关系
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.14,1:04:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.37,1:04:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好可爱 好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.52,1:04:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子进来后变得非常混乱
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.63,1:04:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.23,1:04:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙 难道是
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.67,1:05:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机大厦逃出来的人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.01,1:05:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,在金有大厦周边引起了大骚动
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.11,1:05:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.22,1:05:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到你了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.98,1:05:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.72,1:05:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.39,1:05:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小… 诶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.31,1:05:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.32,1:05:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美 你开心吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.28,1:05:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不开心吧 因为
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.08,1:05:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.83,1:05:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常地悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.83,1:05:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.38,1:05:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要5岁的我的帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.81,1:06:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.19,1:06:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.65,1:06:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到新之助了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.78,1:06:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助在 他在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.12,1:06:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.28,1:06:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不要 住手 好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.37,1:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个奇怪的新发明
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.46,1:06:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会带那种奇怪的东西的只有新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.38,1:06:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.18,1:06:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.27,1:06:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.10,1:06:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.48,1:06:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.07,1:07:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的对手是我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.49,1:07:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿了30年的袜子前来问候
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.79,1:07:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,袜子 花吹雪之术
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.71,1:07:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.88,1:07:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是代表婚后生活的气息
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.17,1:07:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要充满爱不管对方怎样都能忍受 如果做不到的话 就没有结婚的资格
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.51,1:07:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.75,1:07:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.09,1:07:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.05,1:08:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.85,1:08:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然只是件次品
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.60,1:08:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从一出生时
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.68,1:08:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把所有都投资在你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.69,1:08:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个野原新之助身上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.86,1:08:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不想进入金有电机的研究所吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.41,1:08:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那个并不怎么快乐吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.16,1:08:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我就先失陪了 英语叫斑马
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.09,1:08:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.80,1:08:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要违抗我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.80,1:08:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是我的女儿 我可是你的父亲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.10,1:08:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须顺从我 不许违抗我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.39,1:08:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.24,1:09:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话就别怪我无情
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.11,1:09:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你 野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.95,1:09:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,才死的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.19,1:09:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.82,1:09:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,新 之 助 啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.91,1:09:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是久美子你自己选择的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.75,1:09:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你期待着这样的结果吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.95,1:10:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把久美子带过来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.85,1:10:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.22,1:10:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让她为违抗我的行为付出代价
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.35,1:10:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下 社长 现在还是先冷静一下为好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.15,1:10:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静一下？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.57,1:10:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.73,1:10:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 风间
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.41,1:10:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.61,1:10:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.79,1:10:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.95,1:10:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在对谁说要冷静一下呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.83,1:10:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,说教前先看看是对谁
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.83,1:10:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,社长
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.29,1:10:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.62,1:10:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不再是金有电机的员工了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.22,1:10:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子 待在那别动
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.84,1:10:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助都已经死了 就不要再违抗了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.86,1:10:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.10,1:10:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.66,1:11:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.87,1:11:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么风凉话呢 刚才你没看到吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.38,1:11:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.64,1:11:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,被生物橡胶包裹着什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.09,1:11:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,被炸得稀巴烂了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.47,1:11:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没死？哼！不知在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.56,1:11:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个过去的野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.69,1:11:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也已经没有这之后的未来了 已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.48,1:11:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没结束
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.27,1:11:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你这么说 就把你也抓起来再说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.74,1:11:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你后让你也尝尝那滋味
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.40,1:11:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,家电机器人X 出动
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.70,1:11:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊啊 啊 啊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.37,1:12:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.97,1:12:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.37,1:12:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.04,1:12:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.05,1:12:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,家电机器人X 上吧 把他们抓住
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.83,1:12:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.40,1:12:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.97,1:12:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.24,1:12:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.95,1:12:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.32,1:14:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.09,1:14:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.60,1:14:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.27,1:14:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.76,1:14:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.99,1:14:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.49,1:14:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.96,1:14:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.73,1:14:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.30,1:14:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.41,1:15:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.52,1:15:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.95,1:15:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.92,1:15:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.70,1:15:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会死的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.64,1:15:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不会死
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.48,1:15:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.61,1:15:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.11,1:15:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.71,1:15:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个臭小子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.62,1:15:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.36,1:15:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.03,1:16:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新还活着
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.20,1:16:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.04,1:16:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 弄错了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.44,1:16:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指长大后的小新
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.91,1:16:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.08,1:16:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜能量反应完全没减弱
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.05,1:16:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以小新没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.79,1:16:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜能量是？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.95,1:16:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜才有的 完全不遵从物理法则的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.39,1:16:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜的感觉 傻瓜的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.79,1:16:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说 到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.76,1:16:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜的傻劲 非常厉害的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.87,1:16:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.74,1:16:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃惊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.47,1:16:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,积极的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.44,1:16:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,相当厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.07,1:16:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人吃惊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.78,1:16:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜力量
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.08,1:16:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.05,1:16:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 新之助还活着咯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.75,1:16:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.75,1:16:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.19,1:16:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.69,1:16:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么傻瓜力量 野原新之助早被撕成碎片了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.93,1:17:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让我说几遍才懂啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.67,1:17:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.34,1:17:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 野原新之助 才死的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.23,1:17:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.93,1:17:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.81,1:17:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 这是为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.55,1:17:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.99,1:18:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会没固定住
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.86,1:18:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.07,1:18:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 干得好
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.44,1:18:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.24,1:18:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.24,1:18:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是小新
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.24,1:18:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助现在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.84,1:18:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 现在自动飞行式摄像机在追踪中
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.39,1:18:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是金有国
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.55,1:18:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家 走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.72,1:18:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让你们走的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.33,1:18:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有电机的背叛者不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.53,1:18:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.56,1:18:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.60,1:18:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.24,1:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.11,1:19:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.76,1:19:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再来妨碍我了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.76,1:19:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.63,1:19:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了命才有一切
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.74,1:19:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想没结婚就死在这
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.47,1:19:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃跑吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.51,1:19:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.65,1:19:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.11,1:20:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.52,1:20:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.91,1:20:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 妈妈 你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.11,1:20:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,小葵
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.51,1:20:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.79,1:20:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,做什么呢 没当上公务员吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.29,1:20:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话也不打一个
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.99,1:20:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不是说那种话的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.83,1:20:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到好归宿了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.26,1:20:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是说这个的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.60,1:21:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘛 长大了呢 我 很吃惊啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.60,1:21:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.74,1:21:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.27,1:21:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族团聚也就到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.71,1:21:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.25,1:21:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.22,1:21:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.59,1:21:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哇
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.37,1:21:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫猫汽车
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.00,1:21:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来帮忙了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.94,1:21:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.80,1:21:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.81,1:21:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是又被小新怂恿做的？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.01,1:21:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你吧 大人的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.78,1:21:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可比过家家悲惨多了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.02,1:21:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好记住这点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.78,1:21:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.49,1:21:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.69,1:21:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.72,1:21:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.69,1:21:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.79,1:22:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.73,1:22:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,到哪里都有碍事者
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.53,1:22:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,老老实实顺从不就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.68,1:22:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.76,1:22:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.78,1:22:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.44,1:22:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好帅气
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.45,1:22:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心可能会发生这样的事而事先做好的超大机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.95,1:23:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿呆28号
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.86,1:23:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愧是阿呆
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.43,1:23:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美 来帮助我救长大后的我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.60,1:23:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.63,1:23:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你小新
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.47,1:23:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也来帮忙 新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.27,1:23:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.74,1:23:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.60,1:23:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.24,1:23:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.87,1:23:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.24,1:23:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也来
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.64,1:23:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.04,1:23:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,春日部最强防卫队
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.91,1:23:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.55,1:23:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 干的不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.33,1:23:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.74,1:23:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个有意思了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.84,1:23:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.25,1:23:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.88,1:24:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.55,1:24:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.79,1:24:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要从铁轨上结结实实地掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.79,1:24:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.16,1:24:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,葵小姐 摩托车借用一下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.87,1:24:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.77,1:24:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你们得逞吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.67,1:24:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家 快上阿呆28号
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.51,1:24:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.75,1:24:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.85,1:24:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.84,1:25:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.75,1:25:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.08,1:25:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会让你妨碍新之助的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.09,1:25:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.95,1:25:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 阿呆
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.25,1:25:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐就是人生
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.72,1:25:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.94,1:25:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 是我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.17,1:25:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.64,1:25:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好玩
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.35,1:25:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.92,1:25:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.79,1:25:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.12,1:25:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带5岁的你来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.63,1:25:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,初次见面盖浇饭
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.30,1:25:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来的我 你好馄饨面
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.93,1:26:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.97,1:26:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新拜托了 做点什么吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.24,1:26:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.47,1:26:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.68,1:26:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.61,1:26:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 这孩子 还在睡懒觉呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.42,1:26:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.16,1:26:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.10,1:26:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.10,1:26:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你5岁时光溜溜的屁股
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.70,1:26:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说需要5岁的我才把小新带来的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.84,1:26:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么办才好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.71,1:26:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.08,1:26:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让沉睡的公主苏醒
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.45,1:26:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要一个热吻的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.79,1:26:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.89,1:26:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.65,1:26:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么呢 为什么必须是我跟我自己接吻
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.57,1:27:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.81,1:27:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呜呜
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.95,1:27:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.16,1:27:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.49,1:27:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上过山车就要下坡了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.79,1:27:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话 以后都不能再滑行了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.80,1:27:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.80,1:27:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 小新
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.68,1:27:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要永远在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.96,1:28:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.59,1:28:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.83,1:28:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.96,1:28:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.63,1:28:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.77,1:28:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.44,1:28:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.47,1:28:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来和你一起来救我的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.87,1:28:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我要和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.04,1:28:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我还很激动着呢
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.05,1:28:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.65,1:28:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.68,1:28:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.69,1:28:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜能量上升中
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.36,1:28:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.80,1:28:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了不可能的数值
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.40,1:28:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.87,1:28:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.10,1:28:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.07,1:28:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.12,1:29:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,久美子
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.76,1:29:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.64,1:29:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好热
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.41,1:29:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新他们的过山车
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.68,1:29:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.72,1:29:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.55,1:29:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.65,1:29:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,都死了最好
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.55,1:29:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是你自己的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.09,1:29:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.16,1:29:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有父母对自己孩子说你去死的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.09,1:29:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为父母应该对孩子说你要坚强地活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.92,1:30:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰你们二人世界 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.62,1:30:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.39,1:30:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.32,1:30:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.24,1:30:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了 野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.84,1:30:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.35,1:30:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.79,1:30:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成 还需要借助一下你的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.96,1:30:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,五岁的我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.96,1:30:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.69,1:30:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜力量
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.23,1:30:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜力量？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.36,1:30:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让世界光明
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.40,1:31:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人的傻瓜力量不够
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.88,1:31:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔喔喔
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.99,1:31:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜力量填充 120% 火力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.73,1:31:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,全开
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.90,1:31:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全开
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.73,1:31:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,全开
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.47,1:31:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,全开
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.23,1:31:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,全开
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.43,1:32:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,万岁 万岁 傻瓜力量
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.53,1:32:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是天空 蓝天 放晴了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.47,1:32:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老公 你比平时都耀眼
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.37,1:32:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.02,1:33:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.83,1:33:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么明亮的话
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.53,1:33:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,电器的销售额将降为大赤字
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.47,1:33:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会就这样认输的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.81,1:33:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,金有增藏 诱拐 贪污 贿赂 恐吓
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.41,1:33:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,因以上罪被逮捕了 别看我这样
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.12,1:33:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我是国际警察
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.18,1:33:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我输了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.99,1:33:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个才是我生活的明亮世界
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.03,1:33:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 恩 不过还有很多事要做
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.70,1:33:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.93,1:33:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,被太阳照着 好热
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.94,1:33:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不用再穿这么臃肿的外套了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.27,1:33:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,心情好好
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.68,1:33:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上都是黑暗的话会很冷
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.28,1:34:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷的话美女们就不能穿薄的衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.41,1:34:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就跟以前一样
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.95,1:34:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,又可以看到很多穿着泳装的美女了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.75,1:34:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道说那才是你的目的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.32,1:34:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道还有其它目的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.56,1:34:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.76,1:34:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.19,1:34:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个重新给我们带来蓝天的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.46,1:34:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助大人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.10,1:34:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,野原新之助大人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.01,1:34:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,被这么追捧我很烦恼的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.24,1:34:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那样很为难的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.45,1:34:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,新之助 你在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.75,1:34:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果做了不能做的事 绞刑伺候
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.48,1:34:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还是饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.79,1:34:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,退却 退却
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.49,1:34:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 五岁的野原新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.12,1:34:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.69,1:34:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的未来靠你自己把握
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.36,1:34:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你喜欢的事 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.63,1:34:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 新之助
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.13,1:34:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 差点忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.04,1:34:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新 最后的心愿
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.71,1:35:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.77,1:35:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新要成为比新之助还好的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.11,1:35:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.22,1:35:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,小新
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.79,1:35:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.76,1:35:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.59,1:35:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要赶紧长大
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.63,1:35:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人的话绝对有很多好玩的事
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.60,1:35:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.63,1:35:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如果不赶紧回家的话
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.96,1:36:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩 妈妈会担心的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.27,1:36:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.37,1:36:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 明天见了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.87,1:36:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦哦
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.71,1:36:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了 小白
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.35,1:36:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大陨石群落到地球
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.32,1:36:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类会不会全部灭亡呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.79,1:36:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.99,1:36:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 太好了 头发一簇簇的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.29,1:36:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.09,1:36:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,老妈也是 还很苗条呢
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.43,1:36:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.93,1:36:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些时间去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.37,1:36:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看了看未来了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.80,1:36:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚听说了一件很糟糕的事
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.20,1:36:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨大陨石将落到地球
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.81,1:36:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚这样报道了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.71,1:36:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,陨石？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.74,1:36:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,天文学者计算出来
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.51,1:36:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像可以勉强回避的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.65,1:36:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.15,1:36:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.95,1:36:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小葵？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.92,1:36:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,在舔什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.92,1:36:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不行啊 小葵
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.12,1:36:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是时间机器
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.66,1:37:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.96,1:37:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人都给我适可而止
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.66,1:37:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃饭吧
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.73,1:37:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拭去泪水 现在由衷地祝贺你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.43,1:37:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 相信无法预测的未来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.91,1:37:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 旅行之日 为了无法忘记的你的话语 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.61,1:37:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在没有比今天更好的日子里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.53,1:38:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想起来那时真后悔的想哭 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.63,1:38:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只是爱慕着 静止的沙漏 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.77,1:38:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不管多么辛苦都抱有绝不能输的决心 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.78,1:38:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不管到什么时候都忘不了你 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.08,1:38:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在巡游的季节 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.42,1:38:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 带着笑容和泪水来 到这里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.60,1:38:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打从心底现对在的你说声祝贺 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.10,1:38:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为可能发生的奇迹活下去 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.54,1:38:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 旅行之日 为了无法忘记的你的话语 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.31,1:38:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在没有比今天更好的日子里 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.62,1:38:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每次说“祝贺你”的次数都在增加 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.99,1:39:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知不觉变成了“大人” ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.39,1:39:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 本应该在我身边的你已变得遥远 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.93,1:39:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 永远的牵绊 如此企盼的季节 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.47,1:39:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 用了不知多少张照片 不知道多少年来粉饰今天 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.34,1:39:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 合上的相册 在这特别的节目里眼眶发热 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.88,1:39:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 祝你好运 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.95,1:39:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打从心底现对在的你说声祝贺 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.65,1:39:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 选择的路 不动摇的轨迹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.16,1:39:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 旅行之日 “向着明天继续” ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.81,1:39:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在没有比今天更好的日子里 ∮
